<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Batepro half year headline earnings rise.</title>
<headline>Batepro half year headline earnings rise.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Headline shr, (cts)   21.9	  vs 14.4</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 7.0	   vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   8.05	  vs 5.29</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   15.51	 vs 9.50</p>
<p>    Tax			 4.90	  vs 1.69</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   2.29	  vs 2.81</p>
<p>    Turnover		  727.8	 vs 523.7</p>
<p>Full name: Bateman Project Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Engineering group Batepro, which gave no dividend date information, said that -- barring unforeseen circumstances -- it expected to achieve real growth in full year earnings per share on an annualised basis.</p>
<p>The firm said it had made progress in all its operations except its American businesses where activities were improving but not yet meeting targets.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
